title: Election Results
new-page: true
on-arrival: election_live = 0

= November [+ year +]: The Country Votes

**National vote**

<span style="color: #1F4E9C;">**Republicans**</span>: [+ vote_rep +]%
<span style="color: #B5651D;">**Democrats**</span>: [+ vote_dem +]%
<span style="color: #C0392B;">**Farmer-Labor**</span>: [+ vote_fl +]%

**The House of Representatives** (218 needed for a majority)

<span style="color: #1F4E9C;">**Conservative Republicans**</span>: [+ bloc_conservative_rep +]
<span style="color: #7BA7D9;">**Liberal Republicans**</span>: [+ bloc_liberal_rep +]
<span style="color: #8B5A2B;">**Southern Democrats**</span>: [+ bloc_southern_dem +]
<span style="color: #D98C3F;">**Northern Democrats**</span>: [+ bloc_northern_dem +]
<span style="color: #C0392B;">**Farmer-Labor**</span>: [+ bloc_fl +]

**The Senate** (49 needed for a majority)

[+ sen_up +] seats were up. Farmer-Labor won [+ sen_won_fl +] of them.

<span style="color: #1F4E9C;">**Conservative Republicans**</span>: [+ sen_bloc_conservative_rep +]
<span style="color: #7BA7D9;">**Liberal Republicans**</span>: [+ sen_bloc_liberal_rep +]
<span style="color: #8B5A2B;">**Southern Democrats**</span>: [+ sen_bloc_southern_dem +]
<span style="color: #D98C3F;">**Northern Democrats**</span>: [+ sen_bloc_northern_dem +]
<span style="color: #C0392B;">**Farmer-Labor**</span>: [+ sen_bloc_fl +]

Seats that changed hands: [+ sen_changes +]

**Farmer-Labor by region**

The Heartland: [+ seats_heartland_fl +] of [+ seats_total_heartland +] seats ([+ share_heartland_fl +]% of the vote)
The Industrial Belt: [+ seats_industrial_belt_fl +] of [+ seats_total_industrial_belt +] seats ([+ share_industrial_belt_fl +]% of the vote)
The West: [+ seats_west_fl +] of [+ seats_total_west +] seats ([+ share_west_fl +]% of the vote)

